    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9055" root="حمر" body-key="H">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حمّر</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْمِيرٌ</span>: see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>He cut</i>
[a thing] <i>like pieces,</i> or <i>lumps, of flesh-meat.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He dyed</i> a thing <i>red.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  [<i>He
wrote with red ink.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْمِيرٌ</span>, below.] ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>He called</i> another <i>an ass; saying, O ass.</i>
(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <i>He rode a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْمَر</span>; i. e. <i>a horse got by a
stallion of generous race out of a mare not of such
race;</i> or <i>a jade.</i> (A, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  <i>He spoke the language,</i> or <i>dialect, of Himyer;</i> (S, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَمْيَرَ</span></b> . (K.)

